,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這項研究計畫只針對少部分區域實驗，參考價值不高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-13","sourceFront":"區域","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"解決環境受汙染的問題需要長久的計畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-02","sourceFront":"長久","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"計畫 means plan: calculate (計) and draw (畫) the steps."},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-25\",\"多麼\",\"多麼\",\"多么\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個演員非常喜歡演戲，不管導演給他多麼難演的角色，他都願意試試看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-25","sourceFront":"多麼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"軍人接到任務時，不管多麼危險都得努力完成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-30","sourceFront":"接到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 多(many) and 麼(particle): 多麼 means how much."},{"key":"[\"B3L02-1-18\",\"營養\",\"營養\",\"营养\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了家人的健康，媽媽每天都早起準備營養豐富的早餐，讓我們一天的開始就很有精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-18","sourceFront":"營養","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"剩下的飯菜加熱太多次，就沒什麼營養了，最好每餐都吃光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-21","sourceFront":"加熱","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"這家餐廳的菜不僅平價，還很營養，常常中午十二點前舉客滿了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-11","sourceFront":"平價","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有的人一喝牛奶就拉肚子，可能是因為身體吸收不料牛奶的營養。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-25","sourceFront":"吸收","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要想擁有好身材，除了注意營養，還得多運動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-10","sourceFront":"身材","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶奶把變黃的蔬菜葉子埋在地裡，讓它變成草地的營養。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-40","sourceFront":"埋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceL