41","sourceFront":"男性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據手機公司的分析，明年大尺寸手機的市場需求會提高五倍以上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-46","sourceFront":"分析","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不要僅根據表面來判斷一個人或一件事，得花時間深入瞭解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-14","sourceFront":"判斷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據美國某項研究資料，青少年因腦震盪而被送到醫院的意外中，超過一半是因為激烈運動引起的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-03","sourceFront":"腦震盪","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據手術的種類，病人在動手術前能吃的食物也不太相同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-05","sourceFront":"手術","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據氣象資料，這個颱風未來兩天會往西移動，週五起對台灣產生影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-27","sourceFront":"移動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據華人民間的說法，過年時如果收到紅包，整年就會有好運氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-23","sourceFront":"民間","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據本大樓的管理規定，私人物品不可堆在公共區域。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-25","sourceFront":"私人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據醫院規定，進入病房後禁止大聲說話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-29","sourceFront":"進入","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 根(root) and 據(possess): 根據 means according to."},{"key":"[\"B3L14-2-09\",\"錯誤\",\"錯誤\",\"错误\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我每次寫完考卷都會仔細檢查一遍，要是發現錯誤就馬上改過來","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-09","sourceFront":"錯誤","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"費太太結婚後才發現這是個錯誤決定，她不知道該怎麼辦才好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-09","sourceFront":"錯誤","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"