Hook":"a 竹(bamboo) takes a 夭(young) bend → breaking into a 笑(smile)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"錢包\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"錢(money) + 包(wrap) → the wrap for your money: 錢包 is a wallet."}]}
